    "assignment": "Build a horizontally partitioned (sharded) database access flow. Your diagram must include an API layer, a shard router that uses a shard key map/config, and at least two shard databases representing different user_id ranges. Ensure the client can reach each shard through the API and router, and avoid connecting the API directly to any shard database."
